{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b92b03be-4fa5-864e-b5db-4e9eaf5b8ac1",
  "created_at": "2026-03-11T10:55:34-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lidia Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:53:28-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:53:32-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I tried calling last week and got cut off by some robocall in the middle of it. Some recording about my car warranty. So I'm trying again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:53:41-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, sorry about that. Those are the worst. Okay, what's going on with the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:53:46-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My water and sewer bill is wrong. It's way higher than it should be. I need a corrected bill mailed to me. Not emailed, mailed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:53:54-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we can do that. Can I get the name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:53:59-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lidia Semedo. S-E-M-E-D-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:54:01-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, thank you. Okay, I see the account. The last bill was based on an estimated read, which is when we don't get an actual meter reading and we figure it from past use. That can swing a bill up pretty good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:54:14-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's not helpful to me. I'm trying to make a budget. Can you give me the usage month by month? Like a breakdown."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:54:22-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can pull up the billing history and send you the usage for each billing period. Keep in mind it's billed by period, so it may not line up exactly with calendar months."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:54:32-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Whatever you've got. Just put it in with the corrected bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:54:37-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:54:39-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. My daughter helps me with the bills. She's going to be calling sometimes. I want her authorized so I'm not the middle person every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:54:47-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's her name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:54:49-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Her name is Ana Semedo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:54:52-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. I'll note it on the account, but she may need to be added with a signed form. I'll put that in the envelope too so you can fill it out and send it back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:03-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A form. Of course there's a form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:06-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Just one page, I promise. Is the address on file for the mailing still good? I'll read it back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:13-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's the same one. Don't change anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:16-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So that's a corrected bill, the usage history, and the authorization form, all mailed. It should get to you in a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:24-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. I hope it actually shows up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:28-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it doesn't, call me back. Have a good one, Ms. Semedo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T10:55:32-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Bye."
    }
  ],
